      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;awareness-and-experience-isaac-shapiro&#34;&gt;Awareness and Experience Isaac Shapiro&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/teachers/awareness_shapiro.htm&#34;&gt;TW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Author: Isaac Shapiro&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0970357400/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/happens.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/happens.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;book cover&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Purchase Isaac&amp;rsquo;s book &amp;lsquo;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0970357400/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;It Happens by Itself &lt;/a&gt;&amp;rsquo;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.isaacshapiro.de/&#34;&gt;Isaac &amp;rsquo;s website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Link to entry in &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/teachers/teachersp_z.htm#shapiro&#34;&gt;Teachers Section &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Let us consider what we all call experience.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The entire universe, life, time, space, our family, everyone we know, is in this moment simply experience to us. We experience all the above through five senses, so I am calling all experience, sensations. These sensations are then given name and form by our ability to think and make distinctions.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
